{"parse": {"title": "THH-15", "pageid": 64951, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/THH-14\" title=\"THH-14\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">THH-15</span><a href=\"/wiki/THH-16\" title=\"THH-16\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">THH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">15</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9C.8D.E5.8A.A1.E7.83.AD.E7.BA.BF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"服务热线\">服务热线</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 服务热线</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Front Desk Call</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>拨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>通<span class=\"color-value\"></span>电<span class=\"color-value\"></span>话<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>服<span class=\"color-value\"></span>务<span class=\"color-value\"></span>紧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>随<span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>至<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>个<span class=\"color-value\"></span>好<span class=\"color-value\"></span>旅<span class=\"color-value\"></span>馆<span class=\"color-value\"></span>理<span class=\"color-value\"></span>应<span class=\"color-value\"></span>做<span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>些<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2110115</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红房间的中心，摆放着一张雪白的婴儿床。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>垂下的布帘微微摇晃着，如同正在跃动的血管。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>羊首人身的神秘学家伫立于此，她正面对着那模糊透光的薄布，不发一言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步声渐近，她没有回头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>是我的招待还不够周到吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/HeadIconSmall-309912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/HeadIconSmall-309912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/HeadIconSmall-309912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>无论如何，您都不该按断我的电话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生略有歉意地收回了按在电话插簧上的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>也不该隔绝我与外界的联络——尤其是您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>因为您应该知道这意味着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>……为什么我会需要知道这些？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>我只知道，一个这样小的孩子，不应该独自出现在这条公路的附近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>你的母亲呢？她没有告诉你要小心吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她叹出了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>……您的确什么都不记得了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>在您看来，我应该记得什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>噢，很显然，现在这已经不重要了——旅馆的陈设很不错，只有您一个人来打扫这些吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生露出了笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>呵呵……我在想，是不是所有的孩子都是这样？总是故意说些颠三倒四的话语，来吸引母亲的注意力……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>虽然总是被人一眼看穿，但那些童稚的话语总是可爱得让人心尖儿打颤……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>……我不是孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>哈……这也是孩子们常说的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/HeadIconSmall-309912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/HeadIconSmall-309912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/HeadIconSmall-309912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她无奈地妥协了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>我总觉得您亲近又熟悉，好像在很久以前见到过似的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>您能和我说说吗？您为什么独自留在了77号公路附近？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>……也许我能帮上您的忙呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>您听说过《UTTU》这本杂志吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>噢！我知道……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>这是一本有关于时尚、潮流与先锋的杂志……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>我的哥哥曾经很喜欢它，但父亲并不能理解这种喜欢——他认为既然是家里的长子，就应该去开农用机械，而不是阅读这种软绵绵的杂志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>待在家里看书，研究时尚、潮流、迪斯科。这可不是一个德克萨斯男人应该做的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>后来，父亲销毁了所有有关于迪斯科的唱片，连同哥哥那张前往洛杉矶的机票。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>这很好，说明他成功地躲过了那场暴乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>没什么，您对此有什么看法或者意见呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将眼前的侍应生视作采访对象——怪谈背后的女主人，这是一次不容错过的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生略感惊讶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>我应该对此有什么见解吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>或者说，这对您产生了什么影响？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>噢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝手帕陷入了思考，随后她摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>这事情与我无关，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>这都是他们自己所做的选择……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抿上了嘴唇，面孔红润。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>在我刚刚到达这里时，有一位当地的居民说：不要去蓝手帕旅馆居住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>他的婶婶在那个旅店住过，回家后不久便发了疯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>紧锁着的窗户不断地震颤着，发出轻微的响声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>哈……我记得那位女士，她的头很大，总让我想起一些有关于畸形的怪谈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>所以我让她在深夜里“观看”了一场畸形秀，遗憾的是她似乎并不喜欢这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/HeadIconSmall-309912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/HeadIconSmall-309912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/HeadIconSmall-309912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处的收获机被启动了，柴油发动机的声音传入了室内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>这时节的农田，联合收获机一刻也不停地运作着。作物的收获是令人多么高兴的一件事，但与之相伴的噪音却总让孩子担惊受怕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>您听过类似的故事吗？贪玩的孩子前往大型机械的附近，结果被卷入机械中，丢失了一只手，或是一个脑袋……哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>我的旅馆里正好缺了这一类的故事——农田、机械、德克萨斯州、断手或断头的孩子……唔，身临其境的怪谈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窗户的响声愈发焦灼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>啊呀，抱歉，孩子在叫我……如果我再不去，它恐怕又要埋怨我了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>抱歉了，软绵绵的小客人——我很期待下次与您的谈话……和您说话的时候，总有接连不断的好主意从我的脑子里冒出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>但旅店最近的客人实在是太多了……多到令我有些讨厌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生慢悠悠地说着，面孔上再次浮现了红晕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-309914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-309914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-309914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>咳、咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她虚弱地咳嗽着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>您瞧瞧，这样虚弱的孩子，我怎么忍心让您去别的地方……在您的咳嗽病痊愈之前，你尽可以在这个小房间里居住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>我不需要这样的偏爱，居住在小房间也不能治愈我的病症。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>您先睡一觉吧，等精神放松之后，就再也不会有这些胡思乱想了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>……再见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生踩着轻巧的步伐离开了房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在她离去之后，羔羊眼看着门扉从房间之中消失了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_at_kanxueji.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_at_kanxueji\"><img alt=\"2_1_at_kanxueji\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/Cg-2_1_at_kanxueji.png/600px-Cg-2_1_at_kanxueji.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/Cg-2_1_at_kanxueji.png/900px-Cg-2_1_at_kanxueji.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/Cg-2_1_at_kanxueji.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_at_kanxueji.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她望着走廊上残余的血迹，在不久之前，上面还有着一具军官的遗体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>我说过很多次，不要再捡地上的东西吃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>呜哇……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>怀中的襁褓忽然发出古怪的哭声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>好了，别再哭了……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "THH-15"}}